Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.2.12. The main changes are as follows:

1. Fixed the problem of automatically deducting 1000 gold after recruiting mercenaries in the tavern. At present, it is not deducted and will be refreshed automatically after recruitment;
2. Fixed a bug where mercenary mages in training camps upgraded but the Max-HP is not change after using fireball.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.2.6. The main changes are as follows:
1.Fixed the bug that the 5 picture of gallery can not get;
2.Fixed the Diana's head showed wrong in Chapter 11.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.2.5. The main changes are as follows:
1.The game can run in the background;
2.Fixed the freese bug in Chapter 11.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.1.5. The main changes are as follows:
1. Added the quick undo function of the right mouse button in the combat operation;
2. Adjusted the effect of passive skill "Horse’s Endurance" and "accumulate" .

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.1.3. The main changes are as follows:
1. Optimized the display of blood volume in combat animation scene;
2. Accelerated the speed of animation performance;
3. The game display name (upper left corner) is TSM2.
4. When the skills have reached their max level, the "yes" button will not appear when the directional learning interface is opened again.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V1.1.2. The main changes are as follows:
1. Optimized some stories' scene;
2. Adjusted the status of some enemies to make them more challenging.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V0.6.8. The main changes are as follows:
1. Optimization of the interface;
2. Adjustment of various values;
3. The production of a new plot (currently updated to the sixth level, will continue to update with new translations)
4. The adjustment of the battle screen display
5. Add a small battle screen display

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V0.3.5. The main changes are as follows:
1. Optimize some interface;
2. Repaired some bugs；
3、Optimize the sound effects of Sacred Tree's Cave;
4、Add an opening movie.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V0.3.3. The main changes are as follows:
1. Optimize the interface of pub, blacksmith, training camp and upgrade, change the content of upgrade to operate in my team;
2. Repaired the display bug of Sacred Tree's Cave.

Thank you very much for your inclusiveness and support, and for giving us feedback in a timely manner. At present, our development team has updated the version to V0.2.1. The main changes are as follows:
1. Adjust the resources acquired from the main line task, including: the number of skill books, sap, and winning funds;
2. Adjust the difficulty of the main line task;
3. Adjust the difficulty of the monster of the branch task;
4. Adjusting the growth attributes of the characters;
5. Adjusted the role level upper limit, the current level cap is 99;
6. Fixed an error that the window could not be closed when the guard and character skills were viewed;
7. Fixed an error that occurred during the guard operation;
8. Fixed some other known bugs;
9.The transfer system has been added. Currently, there are 28 occupations in the game. When the current occupation reaches a certain level, the transfer will be started. The current transferable level and the maximum level are as follows:
1st stage occupation: 30 (transferable) / 50 (maximum level)
2nd stage occupation: 50 (transferable) / 70 (maximum level)
3rd stage occupation: 90 (maximum level)
10. The new transfer building - the Transfer Temple, when the role reaches the transfer conditions, it will appear in the temple interface;
11. Added two professional skills. After the transfer, everyone has more skills and combinations to facilitate the creation of their own unique heroes;
12. Optimized some of the interfaces (continuous optimization will continue in the future).
