The above are the patch notes for this version. I don't know if you are satisfied with the update of this version, you're welcome to email 5771954@qq.com with feedback.


PS: Since the current server is being filed, the in-game BUG report function is temporarily unavailable, please understand.


In addition, it is a regular notice for the next version's planned changes:
1. Interface optimization;
2. Add new cave exploration methods;
3. Open a new mainline story.


I hope that you will continue to support our game. If you like it, please recommend the game to your friends, we will be very grateful!
